| A handler's field list can rename what it reads. The sender still sends
| `current` and `password`; the body reads words that say which is which.
Change { email, current as current_password, password as new_password } =>
    return Changed {
        who = email
        was = current_password
        now = new_password
    }

emit Change { email = "a@b.c", current = "old", password = "new" } to this get answer
assert answer.who = "a@b.c"
assert answer.was = "old"
assert answer.now = "new"

| A listed field the particle does not carry is still null, alias or not.
emit Change { email = "x" } to this get { was, now as latest }
assert was = null
assert latest = null
